OL,3,GNEWSAExpectant mothers face 'nightmare'
OL,4,Aover Daisy Hill service suspension plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMothers waiting to give birth at Daisy
OL,7,FHill have described Monday's
OL,8,Fannouncement that maternity services
OL,9,Fmay be suspended at the hospital as "a
OL,10,Fkick in the teeth".
OL,12,FIt was reported that no babies will be
OL,13,Fdelivered at the Newry hospital if
OL,14,Fplans for a temporary suspension of
OL,15,Fservices go ahead amid "significant"
OL,16,Fworkforce pressures.
OL,18,FThe Southern Trust has not been able to
OL,19,Frecruit consultant obstetricians to
OL,20,Ffill vacancies and it is preparing to
OL,21,Ftemporarily move inpatient maternity
OL,22,Fservices to Craigavon Area Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
