OL,3,GNEWSAExpectant mothers face 'nightmare'
OL,4,Aover Daisy Hill service suspension plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile Health Minister Robbie Butler
OL,7,Fsaid the move was not final, it is a
OL,8,Fserious problem for those expecting -
OL,9,Flike Carol McGahon who, at 30 weeks
OL,10,Fpregnant, described it as "a
OL,11,Fnightmare".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
